<title>USA: USDA accepts DEIP dry milk bid to Latin America.</title>
<headline>USDA accepts DEIP dry milk bid to Latin America.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said Tuesday it accepted a bid from Ronald A Chisholm (U.S.A.) Inc to sell 128 tonnes of nonfat dry milk to Caribbean, Central and South American nations.</p>
<p>Bonus was $844 per tonne and delivery was set for November 5-December 31.</p>
<p>Remaining DEIP balance for the region was 49,434 tonnes.</p>
</text>
